### Login
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/usuarios/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "senha": "{{senha}}"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.access_token); %}

### Criar milha (entrada)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/milhas/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "programa": "LATAM Pass",
  "tipo": "entrada",
  "quantidade": 1000,
  "origem": "Compra",
  "data_movimentacao": "2026-01-13",
  "data_expiracao": null,
  "descricao": "Bônus promoção"
}

### Listar milhas
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/milhas/?page=1&per_page=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar milha
PUT http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/milhas/{{milha_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "Atualizado"
}

### Excluir milha
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/milhas/{{milha_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
